# Allow members of emobie-input to use uinput for paste inject
# ("Auto-paste on copy"). As-you-type text expansion is deferred for now, so
# no keyboard event-read rule is installed here — see docs/MACROS.md "Known
# limitations". Re-add a `KERNEL=="event*", ENV{ID_INPUT_KEYBOARD}=="1"` rule
# (keyboards only, not mice/joysticks) if/when Expand as-you-type returns.
KERNEL=="uinput", GROUP="emobie-input", MODE="0660", OPTIONS+="static_node=uinput"
